event_description:
&lt;p&gt;Join us October 2–3 at Steamer 10 Theatre for the 11th Annual New York State International Film Festival, a two-day celebration of independent filmmaking from around the world!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doors open at 5:30 PM, with film screenings beginning at 6:00 PM each night. The festival will showcase a diverse selection of local, national, and international independent short films, bringing unique stories, creative voices, and talented filmmakers together for an exciting weekend of cinema.&lt;br /&gt;
We are proud to present the Brendan Fahy Bequette Fund Best Young Filmmaker Award, which includes a $500 cash prize to support and encourage the next generation of independent filmmakers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come experience two nights of great short films, meet filmmakers, participate in Q&amp;A discussions, and celebrate independent cinema at the 11th Annual New York State International Film Festival!&lt;/p&gt;

